# A certain fix in a module only a later round of `check --apply` reads. The
# first round writes `use geom` where this line quotes it; the second reads
# `geom.hero` for the first time, and its `fn` takes a certain fix there,
# which `--apply` never writes in another module and says it did not write.
# Until 2026-10-06 only the first round's fixes in another module were said,
# and this one was neither written nor told, at exit 0.
use geom  #~ use_wants_a_name

function main()
    print(geom.area(side: 3))
